SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the analysis code in this repository and nothing else.
It does not extend to, and this repository does not redistribute:

  - The SIHBS 2022 microdata, which are the property of the Somali National
    Bureau of Statistics (SNBS) and are available from the SNBS microdata
    portal subject to registration and approval by SNBS.
  - The SIHBS unit codebook, which is published in the SIHBS questionnaire
    (SNBS).
  - The non-standard-unit conversion factors, which are published in the
    Somalia Poverty Report 2023, Appendix 2.1, Table B1 (SNBS and World Bank).

These materials must be obtained from their respective sources. The code reads
them from paths supplied by the user at runtime.
